From: Dragongamer9 <Dragongamer9@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] Hearth Files: call hearthFilesSetup() before the about data is registered

Hearth's name and credits (KDE's are kept), the Hearth look where the desktop doesn't give it, and the controller
(hosts/hearth-kde/dolphin/hearth, added to the build by hearth.cmake). The only change to Dolphin's own files.
---
 src/main.cpp | 4 +++-
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

--- a/src/main.cpp
+++ b/src/main.cpp
@@ -80 +80,3 @@
-    KAboutData::setApplicationData(aboutData);
+    void hearthFilesSetup(KAboutData &); // Hearth Files (hosts/hearth-kde/dolphin/hearth/hearthfiles.h)
+    hearthFilesSetup(aboutData);
+    KAboutData::setApplicationData(aboutData);
